```latex
\chessboard{r1bqkbnr/pppp1ppp/2n2n1/8/8/2P2P1/PP1PPPPP/RNBQKBNR}
```

Note that the FEN notation is case-sensitive, so make sure to use lowercase letters for black pieces (e.g., `r` for a rook and `n` for a knight) and uppercase letters for white pieces (e.g., `R` for a rook and `N` for a knight). The FEN notation is explained in detail in the official FIDE Chess Rules document.

